# Test: string repeat via the * operator.
# Before the fix, "ab" * 3 returned null because the Mul opcode only
# handled numeric operands. After the fix, str * int (or int * str)
# repeats the string.
println, "ab" * 3
println, 3 * "ab"
println, "x" * 0
# Expected output: ababab / ababab / (empty line)
